  "observations": [
    "MiYun.getActiveTip splits spell.ActiveTip with | by OPT_SKILL_FLAG1..4; noname dcmiyun roundStart chooseTarget uses branch1.",
    "windowSnitch.initUI first uses getWinOperateDesc; otherwise creates 请选择 + targetName formatted #FFE100 + 的1张牌, with separate min/max and card-specific wording.",
